  "elevationPhilosophy": "The system deliberately avoids drop shadows in favor of 1px inset borders in #f2f0ed to create depth — every surface should look pressed into the page rather than floating above it. The only exception is the dark feature card (#000000), which uses a soft 24px shadow at 15% opacity because dark-on-light needs genuine elevation to separate from the cream canvas. This flat-pressed aesthetic is core to the storybook-on-paper identity.",
